0..80 Comment "//! What a suspension refuses. A decode of a filled code is rigid, so a value of"
81..160 Comment "//! another type is refused there; a comparison between the decodes of two owed"
161..239 Comment "//! codes has no rigid side, so it is the unifier\'s question and refused here,"
240..315 Comment "//! not deferred; and a declaration with one comparison waiting and another"
316..373 Comment "//! refused is refused, the refusal winning over the wait"
374..441 Comment "//! [Slattery-2026-bidirectional_elaborators_carte], Corollary 5.2."
